# Git and GitHub

- **Before you start:** confirm the repository and branch, and that the default branch
  doesn't have a newer version of the file.
- Never commit straight to the default branch: feature branch + pull request. If I ask for
  «push», confirm push-only before anything that merges.
- «Your repository routing: which board or tracker per product, and which values are
  looked up rather than remembered.»
